cff-version: 1.2.0
title: fdstoolkit
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Gustavo
    family-names: Franco
    alias: gufranco
repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/fdstoolkit
abstract: >-
  A Famicom Disk System preservation toolkit: reads and writes every container
  in use, verifies checksums and structure, answers whether two dumps are the
  same release whatever media they came from, predicts what a console does with
  a disk, and dumps or writes real disks through supported hardware.
  Distributes no disk image, no BIOS and no link to either.
keywords:
  - famicom-disk-system
  - famicom
  - preservation
  - emulation
  - quick-disk
license: MIT
